    "date_published": "2025-08-23T05:49:19.864625Z",
    "changelog": "# 2.0.0\n> Updating from 1.x? Please make sure you have sufficient time set asside to read docs, update configs and test changes!\n> Please make sure to read the changes [here](https://github.com/BeepSterr/BetterKeepInventory/releases/tag/v2.0.0-BETA-1) if you are upgrading from 1.x\n\n## Configuration Changes\nSlots & Items are now under a \"filters\" section in the rule config\n```yaml\n      damage:\n        MODE: PERCENTAGE\n        min: 5.0\n        max: 5.0\n        filters: # <-- New!\n          slots:\n          - INVENTORY\n          items:\n          - ALL\n```\n\n## Name & Lore filters\nname & lore filters have been re-added\nPrefix with `!` to negate the check (`!Soulbound` drops items that don't have a lore line \"Soulbound\")\n```yaml\n      drop:\n        mode: ALL\n        filters:\n          name:\n          - 'Neverlost *'\n          lore:\n          - '!Soulbound'\n```\n\n## Misc & Bugfixes\n- Fixed a bug where slots were not parsed correctly\n- Fixed a bug where missing keys would apply rules from the default config\n- Re-Added metrics\n- Changed the default notify_channel to LATEST\n- Updated dependencies",
